        },
        "needle2": {
          "type": "needle",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Protect",
            "text": "<p>Your body breaks NAD⁺ down as fast as it makes it. Pterostilbene, quercetin, grapeseed and turmeric extract are there to keep raised levels raised for longer.</p>",
